<div class="bg-surface-container-high px-4 py-2.5 rounded-t-xl flex items-center justify-between">
<div class="flex items-center gap-2">
<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-error opacity-80"></span>
<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#fbbc04] opacity-80"></span>
<span class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-[#34a853] opacity-80"></span>
<div class="ml-4 flex items-center gap-2">
<img class="w-4 h-4 rounded-full object-cover" alt="" src={asset("logo.png")}/>
<span class="font-headline-sm text-[12px] text-on-surface font-medium tracking-tight">NamiO — tu correo, a tu ritmo</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-3 text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-sm">
<span class="hidden sm:inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-surface-container px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-primary">
<span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-primary animate-ping"></span>
              IMAP Sincronizado
            </span>
<span class="bg-surface-container-highest px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-code-kbd text-code-kbd">⌘K Barra de comandos</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="preview-columns grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 bg-surface-dim rounded-b-xl min-h-[580px] overflow-hidden">

<div class="hidden md:flex md:col-span-3 lg:col-span-2 bg-surface-container-low p-3 flex-col justify-between">
<div class="space-y-4">

<div class="bg-surface-container p-2.5 rounded-xl space-y-1">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider">Cuentas</span>
<span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-primary" title="Cuenta activa sincronizada"></span>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-on-surface">
<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">P</div>
<div class="truncate">
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium leading-none truncate">personal@gmail.com</p>
<span class="font-body-sm text-[12px] text-on-surface-variant">OAuth2 · En línea</span>
</div>
</div>
<div class="flex items-center gap-2 pt-1 text-on-surface-variant transition-opacity cursor-pointer">
<div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-md bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface font-bold flex items-center justify-center text-sm">T</div>
<div class="truncate">
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm leading-none truncate">juan@empresa.com</p>
<span class="font-body-sm text-[12px]">IMAP/SMTP SSL</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<nav class="space-y-0.5 font-body-sm text-body-sm">
<a class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-primary-container/20 text-primary font-medium" href="#">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">inbox</span> Bandeja</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm bg-primary/20 text-primary px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">12</span>
</a>
<a class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">star</span> Destacados</span>
</a>
<a class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">draft</span> Borradores</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant">3</span>
</a>
<a class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">send</span> Enviados</span>
</a>
<a class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">archive</span> Archivo</span>
</a>
<a class="flex items-center justify-between px-2.5 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container hover:text-on-surface transition-colors" href="#">
<span class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]" aria-hidden="true">delete</span> Papelera</span>
</a>
</nav>
</div>

<div class="bg-surface-container p-2.5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-between text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-tertiary" aria-hidden="true">wifi</span>
                Modo sin conexión listo
              </span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-[12px] text-outline font-code-kbd">24.3 MB</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-4 lg:col-span-4 bg-surface-container p-3 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="space-y-2">

<div class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-surface-container-high px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]" aria-hidden="true">search</span>
<input class="bg-transparent text-sm w-full text-on-surface placeholder:text-outline focus:outline-none" placeholder="Buscar correos ( / )..." readonly="" type="text" value="from:equipo"/>
<kbd class="bg-surface-container text-outline px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded font-code-kbd text-[12px]">ESC</kbd>
</div>

<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 pt-1 pb-1">
<span class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary-container text-[12px] font-medium px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md">Todos (12)</span>
<span class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface text-[12px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md cursor-pointer">No leídos</span>
<span class="bg-surface-container-high text-on-surface-variant hover:text-on-surface text-[12px] px-2 py-0.5 rounded-md cursor-pointer">Con estrella</span>
</div>

<div class="space-y-1.5 pt-1">

<div class="bg-primary/10 p-3 rounded-xl cursor-pointer shadow-sm relative">
<div class="absolute left-0 top-2 bottom-2 w-1 bg-primary rounded-r"></div>
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-body-sm font-semibold text-primary">Arquitectura NamiO</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm text-primary font-code-kbd">10:42 AM</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface truncate mt-0.5">Sincronización IMAP local y colas sin conexión</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-1">El nuevo motor almacena cada mensaje localmente para lectura instantánea...</p>
<div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mt-2">
<span class="bg-secondary-container text-on-secondary-container font-body-sm text-[12px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Seguridad</span>
<span class="bg-surface-container-highest text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-[12px] px-1.5 py-0.2 rounded">Correo local</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high p-3 rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Versiones de GitHub</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-code-kbd">Ayer</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface truncate mt-0.5">Novedades del proyecto NamiO</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-1">Se han generado los paquetes automáticos para distribuciones Linux...</p>
</div>

<div class="bg-surface-container-low hover:bg-surface-container-high p-3 rounded-xl transition-colors cursor-pointer">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between">
<span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm font-medium text-on-surface">Comunidad Linux</span>
<span class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant font-code-kbd">24 de mayo</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface truncate mt-0.5">Comentarios sobre el modo "El correo es papel"</p>
<p class="font-body-sm text-sm text-on-surface-variant truncate mt-1">Excelente decisión mantener la lectura en lienzo claro para correos complejos...</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>

<div class="hidden sm:flex items-center justify-between pt-3 text-outline text-[12px] font-code-kbd">
<span>[J/K] Navegar</span>
<span>[E] Archivar</span>
<span>[X] Seleccionar</span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="col-span-1 md:col-span-5 lg:col-span-6 bg-surface-container-lowest p-4 sm:p-6 flex flex-col justify-between">
<div class="space-y-4">

<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2 pb-3">
