                  </span>
</div>
<div class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-sm text-sm flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4">
<span>Para: <strong class="text-on-surface">personal@gmail.com</strong></span>
<span>Fecha: <strong>Hoy, 10:42 AM</strong></span>
</div>
</div>

<div class="bg-white text-gray-900 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg font-body-md text-body-md space-y-3">
<div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-2">
<span class="font-headline-sm text-sm font-bold text-indigo-900 tracking-tight flex items-center gap-1.5">
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px] text-indigo-600" aria-hidden="true">article</span> El correo es papel
                  </span>
